EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello {!Contact.FirstName},


Your account is currently past due {!Case.Past_Due_Balance__c}. To help you avoid late fees we are reaching out about scheduling additional payments to get your account caught up.  Are you in the position to make a full or partial payment at this time?

We can run as a lump sum or split up the balance to run on days of your choice. Please let us know which you prefer.

Thank you,

{!Case.Case_Email_Signature_Name_Formula__c}

National Funding, Inc., the parent and servicing company of
Quick Bridge Funding, LLC

{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}
{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}
P: {!Case.OwnerPhone} | F: {!User.Fax}



